# Feature module patterns (`book` is the reference)

Use `src/modules/book/` as the **complete, canonical example**. New feature modules must match its **folder layout**, **data flow**, **types**, and **export style**.

Scaffold: `bun run create:module <name>` (copies `book`, wires `routeTree.config.ts`, `queryKeys`, header).

## Folder layout (required)

```
modules/{name}/
  services/
    {name}.service.ts  # axios calls via requestHandler
    index.ts           # re-export services
  types/
    {name}.types.ts    # Entity, FormValues, ListParams
    index.ts           # export type *
  utils/
    to{Name}FormData.ts
    normalize{Name}.ts  # normalize*, flatten*Pages, *ToFormValues, pagination meta
    index.ts
  hooks/
    use{Name}.hooks.ts # all query/mutation/form hooks
    index.ts           # named re-exports + UpsertResult type
  components/
    Ct{Name}Form.tsx    # RHF + Ant Design form (named export)
  pages/
    {Plural}ListPage.tsx      # default export
    {Name}DetailPage.tsx
    {Name}UpsertPage.tsx
  routes/
    index.tsx                 # list → /{plural}
    ${name}Id/index.tsx       # detail
    upsert/index.tsx          # create
    upsert/${name}Id.tsx      # edit
```

Register in `src/routeTree.config.ts`: `physical('/{plural}', '../modules/{name}/routes')` under `_panel`.

Add query keys in `src/core/constants/queryKeys.ts`: `{plural}`, `{plural}List`, `{plural}Infinite`, `{name}(id)`.

## Data flow (strict)

```
services/*.service.ts  →  hooks/use{Name}.hooks.ts  →  pages/*Page.tsx
                      ↑
              routes/*.tsx (thin: params + render page only)
```

- **services/** — HTTP only. Top-level functions: `get{Plural}`, `get{Name}ById`, `create{Name}`, `update{Name}`, `delete{Name}`. Use `requestHandler` from `@/core/api/requestHandler`. FormData uploads: no manual `Content-Type`.
- **hooks/** — React Query + RHF. No JSX. Pass-through `UseQueryOptions` / `UseMutationOptions` / `UseInfiniteQueryOptions`. Invalidate via `queryKeys` from `@/core/constants/queryKeys`. Pagination: `pagination.defaultPerPage` from `@/core/constants/pagination`.
- **pages/** — UI only. Import hooks from `@/modules/{name}/hooks`. Use `CtAsyncContent`, `CtLoading`, `CtError` from app module for loading/error.
- **routes/** — `createFileRoute('/_panel/{plural}/…')`, parse numeric ids, render page. **Lazy-import** pages via `React.lazy()` (see `route-lazy-imports.mdc`). **No** data fetching in routes.

## Hooks to implement (match `useBook.hooks.ts`)

| Hook | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `use{Plural}` | list query |
| `useInfinite{Plural}` | infinite list + `getNextPageParam` |
| `use{Name}` | detail by id (`enabled: id > 0`) |
| `useCreate{Name}` / `useUpdate{Name}` / `useDelete{Name}` | mutations + cache invalidation |
| `useCreate{Name}Form` / `useUpdate{Name}Form` | RHF + mutation (optional shortcuts) |
| `use{Name}UpsertForm` | create + edit on one form |

Mutations invalidate `{plural}` list; update/delete also invalidate `{name}(id)`.

## Types (`{name}.types.ts`)

```ts
export type {Name} = { id: number; title: string; … }
export type {Name}FormValues = { title: string; …; cover?: FileList | null }
export type {Plural}ListParams = { page?: number; per_page?: number; search?: string; [key: string]: unknown }
```

Normalize API payloads in `utils/normalize{Name}.ts` (array, `{ data: [] }`, single entity).

## Exports (same as book)

| Location | Export style |
|----------|----------------|
| `pages/` | `export default function …Page()` only |
| `layouts/` | `export default` for layout components (e.g. `CtPanelLayout`); route file `_panel.tsx` uses `export const Route` |
| `components/`, `hooks/`, `services/`, `types/`, `utils/`, `providers/`, `config/`, … | **Named exports only** (enforced by ESLint) |
| `hooks/index.ts` | named re-exports from `use{Name}.hooks.ts` + `export type {Name}UpsertResult` |
| `services/index.ts` | `export * from './{name}.service'` |
| `types/index.ts` | `export type * from './{name}.types'` |

## Routes (same URLs as book)

| Path | Page |
|------|------|
| `/{plural}` | `{Plural}ListPage` |
| `/{plural}/upsert` | `{Name}UpsertPage` (no id) |
| `/{plural}/upsert/{name}Id` | `{Name}UpsertPage` |
| `/{plural}/{name}Id` | `{Name}DetailPage` |

`createFileRoute` paths use `/_panel/{plural}/…`. Links use typed `to` + `params` (e.g. `bookId` → `{name}Id`).

## Do not

- Fetch in route files or call `requestHandler` from pages (go through hooks).
- Put feature types/hooks in `core/` (only shared `queryKeys`, `pagination`, `requestHandler`).
- Invent a different CRUD route layout unless the product explicitly requires it.
- Use `export default` outside `pages/` and `layouts/`.
- Statically import pages in route files — use `lazy(() => import('…/pages/…Page'))` (see `route-lazy-imports.mdc`).

When unsure, **copy `book` and rename** — do not improvise a slimmer module.
